    "chunk_text": "\u00feam \u00fee he gebete swa herbufan awriten is, Eft be gehadodra manna wicnungum. Nis nanum m\u00e6ssepreoste alyfed ne diacone, \u00fe\u00e6t hy gerefan beon ne wicneras, ne ymbe nane Be \u00feam \u00fee gehadod man ge\u00f0oftr\u00e6dene nim\u00f0 wi\u00f0 wifman. Se riht godes \u00feeow \u00fee mid godes \u00feeowdome abysgod by\u00f0, ne gebyre\u00f0 him na to farenne fram stowe to \u00deonne gif hwa \u00feisne gewunan h\u00e6bbe, geswice & bete swa his scrift him t\u00e6ce. Eft be \u00feam ylcan. Se munuc \u00fee hine sylfne gode behat & \u00feone halgan regol underfeh\u00f0, ne gedafena\u00f0 him na \u00fe\u00e6t he Be muneces mishealdnesse & mynecene. Munuc & mynecene \u00fee gode sylfum beo\u00f0 gehalgode & heora gehat gode behaten habba\u00f0, gif hi & gif hi to gode gecyrran wylla\u00f0 \u00fee hy \u00e6r wi\u00f0socon, andettan & beton \u00fea hwile \u00fee hi on life beon Be wifmannes \u00feenunge on godes weofode \u00fee hire to ne gebyra\u00f0. Gelomlice we habba\u00f0 ger\u00e6d on halgum bocum, \u00fe\u00e6t hit alyfed nis \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nig l\u00e6wede wif & unsyfre Be \u00feam \u00fee \u00e6lc sacerd sceal cunnan his gerihto. \u00c6lcon sacerde gebyre\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he cunne \u00fea halgan lare \u00fee to his hade belimp\u00f0 & folc mid l\u00e6ran & Be \u00feam \u00fee sanctus Agustinus sende to rome to sancte Gregorie, & hu sanctus Gregorius him Sona swa sanctus Agustinus on engla \u00feeode fulluht gebroht h\u00e6fde & godes \u00feeowas gehw\u00e6",
